{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41677","headline":"闽中送任畹端公还京 · 陈陶","name":"闽中送任畹端公还京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕台下榻玉爲人，月桂曾输次第春。\n几日酬恩坐炎瘴，九秋高驾拂星辰。\n汉庭凤进鵷行喜，隋国珠还水府贫。\n多少嘉谟奏风俗，斗牛孤剑在平津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41677.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41677","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}